==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be quickly rushed with some fast units like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or other fast units. Otherwise, use tanky or high range units to defeat the stage.

